SUMMARY:Stand-Up Showcase
LOCATION:DC Improv\, 1140 Connecticut Avenue NW\, Washington
DESCRIPTION:Enjoy great stand-up comedy in downtown DC. Our showcase lineup
 s feature top talent from DC\, Maryland\, Virginia and beyond\, performing 
 on one of the country's most famous stages. You'll see a variety of styles 
 and get up close with some of the stars of tomorrow. Support local talent\,
  support local business and (most important) laugh your a** off. Showcases 
 generally last around 90 minutes.\n\nNovember 27-29 lineup: Ivi Demi\, Alex
  Castagne\, Eddie Morrison\, Rahmein Mostafavi\, Christine O'Dea\n\nAll sal
 es are final. Refunds and exchanges are offered only when a show is cancele
 d or rescheduled.\n\nAdmission Policies\n\nPatrons must be 18 or older to a
 ttend events or classes at the DC Improv. Any exceptions are clearly noted 
 in the event descriptions.\n\nThere is a two-item minimum per customer. Thi
 s can be any combination of food items or beverages. Bottled water and soft
  drinks count as items. (The two-item minimum does not apply to comedy clas
 ses.)\n\nCoupons or passes for free admission cannot be used for a show lis
 ted as a "special event."\n\nSeating Policies\n\nAll shows in our lounge sh
 owroom are seated by time of arrival. The earlier you arrive\, the more opt
 ions you'll have. Please note that the size of your party can affect what o
 ptions are available to you\, as certain tables and areas are designated fo
 r larger parties.\n\nFor general admission tickets\, if your party does not
  fill an entire table\, you may be sharing a table with other patrons.\nMor
 e info: https://comedyatlas.app/comedy-atlas/event/stand-up-showcase-67851/
